Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?Quita=20la=20opci=C3=B3n=20de=20descargar=20del?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20video=20de=20hidroterapia=20y=20corrige=20que=20el=20video?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=20del=20hero=20desaparec=C3=ADa=20al=20hacer=20scroll=20r?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=C3=A1pido=20hacia=20arriba=20(se=20recarga=20autom=C3=A1ticame?=
 =?UTF-8?q?nte=20si=20el=20navegador=20liber=C3=B3=20el=20recurso)?=
